  "id": "dopamine-system",
  "term": "dopamine system",
  "definition": "The dopamine system is the set of brain structures and connections involved in dopamine function. In this source, it especially refers to dopamine-related activity, structure, and connectivity in the substantia nigra pars compacta and ventral tegmental area, including aspects beyond synaptic transmission.",
